### 4. Component Initialization - Complete Replacement

**REMOVE this entire Beta pattern:**

```javascript
$Lightning.use(
  'c:OrgFarmOut',
  function () {
    $Lightning.createComponent(
      'c:loBetaEntryForm',
      { contactId: '003...' }, // attributes
      'lightning-out', // DOM target
      function (cmp) {
        console.log('created');
      },
    );
